  "details": "This module implements a field formatter for text fields that improves the *Summary or Trimmed* formatter built into Drupal core.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently escape unsafe HTML when passed through the module's Twig filter.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an attacker must have a role with the ability to post content that gets passed through a Twig template with one of the `|smart_trim_*` filters provided by this module.\n\nIf a site uses only use the field formatter without the Twig filter, it is not vulnerable.",
